   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Greeting/Tuning**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Leanng On A Travelin' Song**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Blue Mule**: back after 68 archived shows (489 days); rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Maggie Walker Blues**: back after 67 archived shows (476 days); rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **#@Matty Groves**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Thanks/Band Introdctions**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Gonna Lay Down My Old Guitar**: back after 64 archived shows (442 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2025-04-18** (recommended): source not stated; 29 songs; 156 min [1]\n- **billy-strings-2025-04-18-koka-booth-ampitheater-cary-nc-0209_20250420**: source not stated; 27 songs; 154 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Billy [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2025-04-18**: taped by Z-Man; transferred by Z-Man; source: Schoeps CCM4V'S>Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II (48/32) [1]. Also: Recorded and seeded by Z-Man with Schoeps CCM4V microphones into a Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II at 48kHz/32-bit; Mics were placed 65 feet from the stage at 6.5 feet high; processed through Sound Forge and CD Wave to 16-bit FLAC; TJ Ennis was taper's assistant; this is listed as show number 91 of 2025, a Team Dirty South and Home Team Recording [1]\n- **billy-strings-2025-04-18-koka-booth-ampitheater-cary-nc-0209_20250420**: Captured with Neumann SKM-140 microphones through a Lunatec V3 into a Sound Devices 702 recorder; Cleaned in iZotope RX9 for clicks, pops and fades, then edited in CD WAV Editor; recorded by Michael Clark and Rae Anderson [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Koka Booth Amphitheatre - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/koka-booth-amphitheatre/) [4]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Koka Booth Amphitheatre - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/koka-booth-amphitheatre/) [5]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Koka Booth Amp 2025 - N2 Regular Poster - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/koka-booth-amp-2025-n2-regular-poster/) [6]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Koka Booth Amp 2025 - N3 Regular Poster - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/koka-booth-amp-2025-n3-regular-poster/) [7]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Koka Booth Amp 2025 - N1 Regular Poster - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/koka-booth-amp-2025-n1-regular-poster/) [8]\n- Poster by WUKONG288: [WUKONG288 – Situs Casino Online Terpercaya dengan Live Casino dan Akses APK Resmi](https://monepatee.com/product/billy-strings-merchandise-at-koka-booth-amphitheatre-on-april-18-2025-in-cary-nc-home-decor-poster-canvas/) [9]",
